  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "入口与鉴权",
      "items": [
        "server 只绑 127.0.0.1:3773；公网入口是 443 的 nginx 与 8443 的 tailscale serve",
        "nginx 全量 auth_request 到 t3-sso：带 Authorization 的放行交给 T3 自己校验，否则走 SSO 登录",
        "/.well-known/t3/environment 与 /api/provider-usage-summary 免 SSO"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "单一 server 约束",
      "items": [
        "两个 serve 进程共用 state.sqlite 却各自维护内存投影，桌面与手机会互相看不到新消息",
        "t3 拦截层把桌面端的 serve 变成 TCP 转发；t3code-portwatch 每 10 秒兜底并重装拦截层",
        "server 还对 agent 提供 MCP（McpHttpServer、ACP stdio bridge）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "发布流程",
      "items": [
        "release-hub rsync 到 /opt/t3code，t3code-deploy.sh 做 tsc、web 与 server 构建",
        "dist 同步到 ~/.t3/selfbuilt/t3code，先备份，失败自动回滚",
        "重启 t3code.service 后等 3773 返回 200，健康窗口 20 分钟"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
